            "notes": "Now we get to go  [Foxy Fireworks](item_d29ac7bb-d84c-44d7-8944-24c9b668b657)! Remember to start angling on the enemy to get in good damage, and TP back to your team when you dont feel safe. If you manage to get 1 on 1 with a squishy (non tank), shoot 3 times, suzu, shoot again, suzu again, and there is almost no way they can kill u without any help. \n\nFor items, I sell  [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718) for now to grab  [Ry\u014dta\u2019s Reloader](item_5cabe555-3845-49fa-9941-71b870c2c164) as it is extremley vital to this build. Otherwise max weapon power with your remaining cash (SOme survival if needed).",
